{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shiyi-e-0c82ea38263372bf87a0","title":"胡综酒后推引杯觞搏击左右，孙权爱才不责","accounts":[{"id":"shiyi-a-0c82ea38263372bf87a0","label":"正文","text":"胡综酒后推引杯觞搏击左右，孙权爱才不责","evidence":["shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0091","role":"酒后搏击者","evidence":["shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"不责者","evidence":["shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf"]},"ordering_evidence":"shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf","order":10839}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0091","name":"胡综","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-2e23fafc1a66ca77e1bf","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1014cbd7fb1d674df9bc","layer":"original","quote":"性嗜酒，酒后欢呼极意〖1〗；或推引杯觞，搏击左右。权爱其才，弗之责也。凡自权统事，诸文诰策命〖2〗，邻国书符〖3〗，略皆综之所造也。初，以内外多事，特立科〖4〗：“长吏遭丧〖5〗，皆不得去〖6〗。”而数有犯者，权患之，使朝臣下议〖7〗。综议以为：“宜定科文，示以大辟〖8〗。行之一人，其后必绝。”遂用综言，由是奔丧乃断。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
